      "hash64": "88F0E1EE2844B4BA",
      "text": "如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不嫌棄，\\n就請再來找我對戰吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
