    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "7FEEC80545C9560F",
      "text": "我難得加油一下了～\\c\\n如果有讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看到老師我\\n帥氣的一面，那我就很高興了～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
