    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_teacher_ecology_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "2B971600F5690C36",
      "text": "生態巨蛋真的是\\n相～當相當有意思啊～\\c\\n有很多很多寶可夢\\n是在帕底亞見不到的呢～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
